        {
          "id": "11285",
          "author": {
            "accountId": "712020:d3ffd30a-2b90-4bcc-99d4-29fe0303d278",
            "emailAddress": "cedrick@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Cedrick Infantado",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"1db8a0581cd6\"><span data-local-id=\"1befb7d6-9336-45bf-927d-2ff510da5d3d\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:61966a85-61f2-42ce-8382-85568cc7e090\">@Kobi Kunasekaran</span>  This task mentions a known bug affecting the state/country. Could you please share that specific issue with me so I can investigate further?</p><p data-local-id=\"9d6d95acecf2\">So far, here are my observations:</p><ol data-local-id=\"d48c3837a8b2\"><li data-local-id=\"25c7b2f7a392\"><p data-local-id=\"875de70df233\">The player currency is assigned in the flow for new player records: <strong>SLC_After_Save_Player_DRA_and_Sign_Up.</strong></p></li><li data-local-id=\"19b9c543b31d\"><p data-local-id=\"0ed7c488c257\">The formula that sets the currency references the Player_Country__c field:</p></li></ol><pre data-local-id=\"710299f4-a33d-4e0a-99d8-cd9917f7434a\" data-wrap=\"true\"><code>IF(\n  ISBLANK({!$Record.Player_Country__c}),\n  TEXT({!$Record.CurrencyIsoCode}),\n  CASE(\n    UPPER(TRIM({!$Record.Player_Country__c})),\n    &quot;CA&quot;,             &quot;CAD&quot;,\n    &quot;CAN&quot;,            &quot;CAD&quot;,\n    &quot;CANADA&quot;,         &quot;CAD&quot;,\n    &quot;US&quot;,             &quot;USD&quot;,\n    &quot;USA&quot;,            &quot;USD&quot;,\n    &quot;UNITED STATES&quot;,  &quot;USD&quot;,\n    TEXT({!$Record.CurrencyIsoCode})\n  )\n)</code></pre><ol data-local-id=\"92b08922559a\" start=\"3\"><li data-local-id=\"4263c9ce94d0\"><p data-local-id=\"38fbaad2eb2b\">The majority of the SLC records do not have data for <strong>Player_City__c, Player_State__c, </strong>or<strong> Player_Country__c</strong> (see attached). Overall, only 49 out of 1,415 records have a value for <strong>Player_Country__c</strong>. <span data-local-id=\"890e652c8270\" data-type=\"media-inline\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-media-id=\"ea773419-c08d-4716-93a9-01c1743c6274\"></span> </p></li></ol>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:d3ffd30a-2b90-4bcc-99d4-29fe0303d278",
            "emailAddress": "cedrick@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Cedrick Infantado",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "created": "2026-09-22T10:57:33.907-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-22T10:58:05.191-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
