            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"03b6f5f9aee2\"><span data-local-id=\"6cd438fd-b9da-414d-884a-649acfab71a4\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:d3ffd30a-2b90-4bcc-99d4-29fe0303d278\">@Cedrick Infantado</span> to check the full Player mapping per <span data-local-id=\"488734fd-6229-43fa-b1f9-74b2e08b74e1\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:61966a85-61f2-42ce-8382-85568cc7e090\">@Kobi Kunasekaran</span>.</p>",
