            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"e1296c268508\"><span data-local-id=\"64b57b26-b9dc-43ce-beac-f3d73b03ab3c\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:61966a85-61f2-42ce-8382-85568cc7e090\">@Kobi Kunasekaran</span> <span data-local-id=\"92ca9610-469e-45b0-a2f9-72873001eecb\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d\">@Taryn Reithofer</span> <br><br>The player address is currently mapped to the standard billing address. On the player page, we are displaying custom fields for the country and state/province. Would you like me to map these to the custom fields instead?</p><figure data-local-id=\"6bed9efe2a06\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"566\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"0ff01c92-d51e-4652-9b51-319bdfd421d6\" data-alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-22 at 11.55.43 PM.png\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"783\"></div></figure><figure data-local-id=\"ebe4e1f83529\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"566\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"2feabb51-2b40-4948-b513-85cf2869c4d8\" data-alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-22 at 11.58.39 PM.png\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"783\"></div></figure>",
